PROFESSIONAL SERVICES AGREEMENT
for
Landfill Mapping and Surveying Services
THIS AGREEMENT is made and entered into this 12th
day of
April
, 2021,
by and between the City of Cheyenne, located at 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming
82001 (“City”), and KU
Engineering, located at 4585 Coleman Street, Bismark, North Dakota
58503 (“Consultant”).
RECITALS
In consideration of the mutual covenants and obligations herein expressed, it is agreed by and
between the parties as follows:
1.
SCOPE OF WORK
The Consultant agrees to provide services as described for the above-mentioned project,
in accordance with the Scope of Work attached hereto as Exhibit A and Exhibit B,
incorporated by reference and expressly made a part hereof
2.
TIME OF PERFORMANCE
The work included in this Scope of Work will be completed within one year of Notice to
Proceed. The City and KU Engineering can, with written agreement, extend the contract
for an additional two years as outlined in Exhibit A.
3.
COMPENSATION
In consideration of the services to be performed pursuant to this Agreement, the
Consultant will bill the City and the City agrees to pay Consultant a not to exceed amount
of Twenty-Nine Thousand Six Hundred Sixteen Dollars ($29,616.00) for the first year
of the contract as stated in Exhibit B. Each additional year the contract is renewed for, the
City agrees to pay Consultant a not to exceed amount of Twenty Thousand Six Hundred
Thirty-Eight Dollars ($20,638.00) as stated in Exhibit B.
4.
CONSULTANT RESPONSIBILITY
In providing services under this Agreement, the Consultant shall perform in a maimer
consistent with that degree of care and skill ordinarily exercised by members of the same
profession
currently practicing under similar
circumstances.
Upon notice
to
the
Consultant, the Consultant will, without additional compensation, correct those services
not meeting such a standard.
5.
COMPLIANCE WITH LAWS
The Parties agree that they will perform their obligations as provided in this Agreement
in accordance with all applicable laws and ordinances.
